sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Envoy
    participant G as iroh-gateway
    participant D as Desktop node
    E->>G: 1 · HTTP request<br/>(via Unix socket)
    G->>D: 2 · resolve endpoint ID<br/>from request metadata
    G->>D: 3 · open QUIC stream<br/>(reuse connection or establish new one)
    G->>D: 4 · forward request<br/>over QUIC stream
    D-->>G: 5 · HTTP response
    G-->>E: 6 · HTTP response
